{"version":1,"content":"<p>港姐出身的嘉碧儀當年以頂頭大熱飲恨落選，曾與陳宇琛及洪天明爆緋聞的她，於2005年淡出往美國修讀法律並長留當地發展。</p><p>神隱近20載的她年前罕有於社交網分享生活照，雖年屆47歲但美貌依舊靚樣不變。</p><p>而她與一名外藉男子親密合照更曝光，似是其另一半，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T04:23:03.930691+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:01:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:38.662968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:18:38.662968+00:00","content_hash":"7e62c19d8f145cb1e2b211e8901be1dcaed5491faff725a6a17f2ef63e57e66e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}